ம்","gloss":"drought"}],"gloss":"drought"},{"surface":"கூர்ந்த","parts":[{"text":"கூர்ந்த","lemma":"கூர்","gloss":"intense"}],"gloss":"intense"},{"surface":"வேனில்","parts":[{"text":"வேனில்","lemma":"வேனில்","gloss":"summer"}],"gloss":"summer"},{"surface":"காலை","parts":[{"text":"காலை","lemma":"காலை","gloss":"time"}],"gloss":"time"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பசித்த","parts":[{"text":"பசித்த","lemma":"பசி","gloss":"hungry"}],"gloss":"hungry"},{"surface":"ஆயத்து","parts":[{"text":"ஆயத்து","lemma":"ஆயத்து","gloss":"of the herd"}],"gloss":"of the herd","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பயன்","parts":[{"text":"பயன்","lemma":"பயன்","gloss":"yield"}],"gloss":"yield"},{"surface":"நிரை","parts":[{"text":"நிரை","lemma":"நிரை","gloss":"herd of cattle"}],"gloss":"herd of cattle"},{"surface":"தருமார்","parts":[{"text":"தருமார்","lemma":"தரு","gloss":"to bring"}],"gloss":"to bring"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பூ","parts":[{"text":"பூ","lemma":"பூ","gloss":"flower"}],"gloss":"flower"},{"surface":"வாள்","parts":[{"text":"வாள்","lemma":"வாள்","gloss":"sickle"}],"gloss":"sickle"},{"surface":"கோவலர்","parts":[{"text":"கோவலர்","lemma":"கோவலர்","gloss":"herdsmen"}],"gloss":"herdsmen"},{"surface":"பூவுடன்","parts":[{"text":"பூ","lemma":"பூ","gloss":"flower"},{"text":"உடன்","lemma":"உடன்","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with flowers"},{"surface":"உதிர","parts":[{"text":"உதிர","lemma":"உதிர்","gloss":"to fall"}],"gloss":"to fall"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கொய்து","parts":[{"text":"கொய்து","lemma":"கொய்","gloss":"having plucked"}],"gloss":"having plucked"},{"surface":"கட்டு","parts":[{"text":"கட்டு","lemma":"கட்டு","gloss":"bundle"}],"gloss":"bundle"},{"surface":"அழித்த","parts":[{"text":"அழித்த","lemma":"அழி","gloss":"destroyed"}],"gloss":"destroyed"},{"surface":"வேங்கையின்","parts":[{"text":"வேங்கை","lemma":"வேங்கை","gloss":"Kino tree"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like the Kino tree"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மெல்","parts":[{"text":"மெல்","lemma":"மெல்","gloss":"soft"}],"gloss":"soft"},{"surface":"இயல்","parts":[{"text":"இயல்","lemma":"இயல்","gloss":"nature"}],"gloss":"nature"},{"surface":"மகளிரும்","parts":[{"text":"மகளிர்","lemma":"மகளிர்","gloss":"women"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"also"}],"gloss":"women also"},{"surface":"இழை","parts":[{"text":"இழை","lemma":"இழை","gloss":"ornaments"}],"gloss":"ornaments"},{"surface":"களைந்தனரே","parts":[{"text":"களைந்தனரே","lemma":"களை","gloss":"they removed"}],"gloss":"they removed"}]}],"literal":"Without guarding fortresses, conquering in battle / along with companions, emptying jars of toddy / protecting the large families of bards / in the court of great justice where righteousness is established / praised by those who know the law well / with women of flawless character and pure nature / having walls with many weapons in the shape of the sun / tall sacrificial posts where eagles feed / completing the duties of Vedic sacrifices / he indeed knew, the wise king / he who passed away, alas, this world / waterfalls having dried up, fearfully withered / in the summer season of intense drought / to bring back the yielding herd for the hungry group / herdsmen with flower-cutting sickles, along with flowers falling / like the Vēṅkai tree whose branches were plucked and broken / the gentle-natured women also removed their ornaments.","translation":"Without caring for fortresses, he conquered in battles. Along with his companions, he emptied jars of toddy. He protected the large families of bards. In the court of great justice where righteousness is established, praised by those who know the law well, he lived with women of flawless character and pure nature. Within walls shaped like the sun and armed with many weapons, he completed the duties of Vedic sacrifices, erecting tall sacrificial posts where eagles feed. He, the wise king, knew all these. Now that he has passed away, alas, this world is like the Vēṅkai tree in the intense drought of summer, when waterfalls have dried up and everything is fearfully withered; to feed their hungry herds, herdsmen with flower-cutting sickles pluck and break its branches, shedding all its flowers. Even so, his gentle-natured women have removed all their ornaments.","modern":"கோட்டைகளைக் காக்க நினையாமல் போரில் வென்றதும், தோழர்களுடன் சேர்ந்து மதுக்குடங்களை வெறுமையாக்கியதும், பாணர்களின் பெரிய சுற்றத்தைக் காத்ததும், அறம் தவறாத நெறிமிக்க அவையத்தில் முறை அறிந்தவர்களால் புகழப்பட்டதும், குற்றமற்ற ஒழுக்கமுடைய மகளிரோடு வாழ்ந்ததும், சூரியன் போன்ற வட்ட வடிவமான மதில்களை உடையதும், பருந்துகள் உண்ணும் பலிபீட யூப நெடுந்தூண்களை நட்டு வேத வேள்விகளை முடித்ததும் ஆகிய அனைத்தையும் அந்த அறிவுடைய அரசன் அறிந்திருந்தான். அவன் இறந்துவிட்டான். ஐயோ! அருவிகள் வற்றி, அஞ்சத்தக்க வகையில் கருகி, பெரும் வறட்சி மிக்க கோடைகாலத்தில், பசியோடு இருக்கும் பசுக்கூட்டங்களுக்குத் தழைகளைத் தருவதற்காக, பூக்களைக் கொய்யும் அரிவாளை உடைய இடையர்கள், பூக்களோடு கிளைகளை ஒடித்து அழித்த வேங்கை மரத்தைப் போல, இந்த உலகத்தில் மென்மையான இயல்புடைய மகளிர் தங்கள் அணிகலன்களைக் களைந்துவிட்டனர்.","explanation":"The poet Karuṅkuḻal Ātaṉār is singing a lament (kaiyaṟunilai) on the death of the Chola king Karikāl Peruvaḷattāṉ. The poet recalls the great deeds of the king—his military victories, his generosity to bards, his adherence to justice, his domestic life, and his performance of Vedic sacrifices. Now that the king is dead, the poet laments the state of the kingdom. The poet uses a powerful simile of a Vēṅkai tree during a harsh summer drought. Just as herdsmen strip the Vēṅkai tree of its leaves and flowers to feed their hungry cattle, leaving it bare and ruined, the women of the palace have stripped themselves of their beautiful ornaments in mourning. This image of desolation perfectly captures the grief and loss felt by the entire land after the demise of their protective ruler.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.7],[0.7,1.63],[1.63,2.2],[2.2,3.1],[3.1,3.3],[3.52,4.2],[4.2,4.7],[4.7,5.7],[5.7,5.7],[5.7,6.1],[6.1,7.0],[7.0,7.36],[7.36,7.36],[7.36,7.7